---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';const levels=[['Apprentice','Available in v0.1','Breadth and foundation','Gain experience across the entire framework. Challenges are generally required, with choices inside some challenges. Practice under guidance and demonstrate foundational understanding.'],['Pathfinder','Developing','Competence and depth','Build on broad experience with increasing specialization and choice. Future curriculum will expect sustained practice, sound judgment, and useful service.'],['Vanguard','Developing','Maturity and responsibility','Grow toward mastery, leadership, service, and the ability to disciple and teach others. Future curriculum will connect competence with responsibility for others.']];
---
<Layout title="Three Levels"><section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">A trajectory of maturity</span><h1>Three levels. Growing responsibility.</h1><p>Progression should reflect character, competence, and faithful service as well as completed work. Only Apprentice sample challenges are available in this prototype.</p></section><section class="level-pages">{levels.map(([name,status,title,text],i)=><article><Icon name={name.toLowerCase()} size={42}/><span class="eyebrow">0{i+1} · {status}</span><h2>{name}</h2><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p>{i===0&&<a class="button" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}challenges/`}>Open Apprentice challenges</a>}</article>)}</section></Layout>
